<p><span style="color: #2C7500;"><strong>General Information</strong></span></p>
<p>Due to the fluctuations of the exchange rate, orders with value very close to the tax-free limit may be assessed Duties and Taxes (D&amp;T) as the currency exchange rate may vary from the order date to the customs clearance date.</p>
<p>Please check with your local customs office to see if you can import the items, and if any additional licenses or permits are needed.</p>
 
<!-- END GENERAL INFORMATION  -->
 
<!-- START Customs Information -->
<p><span style="color: #2C7500;"><strong>Customs Information</strong></span></p>
<p>For information about customs, import duties, etc., visit: <a href="https://www.fbr.gov.pk/categ/imports-exports/51149/70850/131173">Import Restrictions Page</a></p>
<!-- END Customs Information →
 
<!-- START Shipping Information  -->
 <p><span style="color: #2C7500;"><strong>Shipping</strong></span></p>
 
<p>All iHerb orders are shipped out from our US warehouses to your country by Air Freight.&nbsp;</p>
<p>The Estimated Delivery window provided by iHerb reflects most standard deliveries. However, some orders may occasionally be subject to longer transit time caused by air freight delay, Customs hold, or any other unforeseen complications outside of iHerb’s control.</p>
 
 
<p>You may have to pay import taxes, customs duties, and/or a brokerage (handling) fee for your order. These charges are separate from your shipping fee and you will be billed directly from the carrier of your choice.</p>
 
<ul>
<li><strong>DHL Express:</strong> For shipping related inquiries regarding DHL Express orders, please contact the DHL Express Customer Service at +92 21 111 345 111</li>
 
 <p>  For more information about DHL's processing fees and any other queries in relation to shipping with DHL, please contact via <a href="http://www.dhl.co.ug/en/contact_center/contact_express.html">DHL’s contact page</a></p>
  
<li><strong>FedEx:</strong> For shipping related inquiries regarding FedEx orders, please contact the FedEx call center at 7080601198</li>
  
</ul>

<!-- END SHIPPING INFORMATION  -->
 
<!-- START Restrictions Information -->
<p><span style="color: #2C7500;"><strong>Restrictions</strong></span></p>
<p>At iHerb, we respect the rules and regulations of the government of Pakistan and do our best to block Customs prohibited products from our site.
For information about prohibited and restricted products please visit: <a href="https://www.fbr.gov.pk/categ/imports-exports/51149/70850/131173">Import Restrictions Page</a></p>
